    <span class="hidden sm:inline text-blue-100">— our biggest upgrade yet: 6-step onboarding wizard, bulk CSV enrolment, mass promotion and an SMS wallet.</span>
    <a href="#upgrade" class="underline decoration-blue-300 hover:decoration-white font-semibold ml-1">See what's new →</a>
</div>

