                        empty dashboard.
                    </p>
                    <ul class="mt-8 space-y-3 text-gray-700">
                        <li class="flex gap-3"><span class="text-blue-600 font-bold">✓</span> <span><strong>Smart Dashboard</strong> — real-time collections, debt and stock signals.</span></li>
                        <li class="flex gap-3"><span class="text-blue-600 font-bold">✓</span> <span><strong>6-Step Onboarding Wizard</strong> — identity, classes, calendar, fee items and prices.</span></li>
                        <li class="flex gap-3"><span class="text-blue-600 font-bold">✓</span> <span><strong>Branding &amp; Settings</strong> — logo, hero image, colours and public website content.</span></li>
                    </ul>
                </div>
                <div class="mt-10 lg:mt-0">
                    {{ _self.browser('screencapture-demo-edus-ng-onboarding-structure-2026-04-21-13_48_10.png', 'Edus onboarding wizard — building class structure', 'h-64 lg:h-80') }}
                </div>
            </section>

            {# 2. ADMISSIONS & STUDENT RECORDS #}
            <section class="lg:grid lg:grid-cols-2 lg:gap-16 lg:items-center reveal">
                <div class="lg:order-2">
                    <span class="text-xs font-bold uppercase tracking-widest text-blue-600">02 · Admissions &amp; Student Records</span>
                    <h3 class="mt-3 text-2xl sm:text-3xl font-extrabold text-gray-900">From enquiry to enrolled in minutes</h3>
                    <p class="mt-4 text-lg text-gray-500">
                        A searchable student registry with debtor/cleared filters, an admission workflow that finds
                        existing parents (so siblings link automatically), and bulk tools for the September rush.
                    </p>
                    <ul class="mt-8 space-y-3 text-gray-700">
                        <li class="flex gap-3"><span class="text-blue-600 font-bold">✓</span> <span><strong>Student Registry</strong> — filters, split academic/store debt badges, CSV export, print ID cards.</span></li>
                        <li class="flex gap-3"><span class="text-blue-600 font-bold">✓</span> <span><strong>Admissions &amp; Enrolment</strong> — auto admission numbers, discounts and a printable admission letter.</span></li>
                        <li class="flex gap-3"><span class="text-blue-600 font-bold">✓</span> <span><strong>Bulk Enrolment</strong> — grid entry or 12-column CSV upload with auto-invoicing.</span></li>
                        <li class="flex gap-3"><span class="text-blue-600 font-bold">✓</span> <span><strong>Mass Promotion</strong> — promote, mark repeaters and bill the new session in one pass.</span></li>
                    </ul>
                </div>
                <div class="mt-10 lg:mt-0 lg:order-1 grid grid-cols-2 gap-4">
                    {{ _self.browser('screencapture-gobarau-localhost-8082-admission-register-1-2026-04-21-15_07_41.png', 'Student admission form', 'h-56 lg:h-72') }}
                    {{ _self.browser('screencapture-demo-edus-ng-quick-enroll-2026-04-21-13_54_47.png', 'Bulk student enrolment grid', 'h-56 lg:h-72') }}
                    <div class="col-span-2">
                        {{ _self.browser('screencapture-gobarau-localhost-8082-students-10-profile-2026-04-21-21_24_01.png', 'Student profile with finance ledger', 'h-52 lg:h-64') }}
                    </div>
                </div>
            </section>

            {# 3. ACADEMIC STRUCTURE #}
            <section class="reveal">
                <div class="lg:grid lg:grid-cols-2 lg:gap-16 lg:items-end">
                    <div>
                        <span class="text-xs font-bold uppercase tracking-widest text-blue-600">03 · Academic Structure &amp; Administration</span>
                        <h3 class="mt-3 text-2xl sm:text-3xl font-extrabold text-gray-900">Your school's structure, modelled properly</h3>
                    </div>
                    <p class="mt-4 lg:mt-0 text-lg text-gray-500">
                        Sessions and terms with single-active enforcement, class arms generated automatically
                        (type "JSS 1", get JSS 1A, 1B, 1C…), year groups, departments, subjects and role-based
                        staff accounts with one-click academic assignments.
                    </p>
                </div>

                <div class="mt-10 grid gap-4 sm:grid-cols-2 lg:grid-cols-3">
                    {% set academic = [
                        { 'icon': '🗓️', 'title': 'Sessions & Terms', 'text': 'Single-active enforcement keeps billing and results pointing at the right period.' },
                        { 'icon': '📚', 'title': 'Smart Class Creator', 'text': 'Enter a level and the number of arms — the system generates every class.' },
                        { 'icon': '📂', 'title': 'Year Groups', 'text': 'Group all the arms of a level for form-teacher and year-group workflows.' },
                        { 'icon': '🏛️', 'title': 'Departments', 'text': 'Sciences, Arts, Business… organised with a clear Head of Department span.' },
                        { 'icon': '📖', 'title': 'Subject Catalogue', 'text': 'Subjects with codes and department assignment — ready for timetabling.' },
                        { 'icon': '🗂️', 'title': 'Class Subjects', 'text': 'Choose which subjects each class offers per session, tagged core or elective.' },
                        { 'icon': '🏅', 'title': 'Grading Scale', 'text': 'A1–F9, WAEC, NECO or custom ranges, points and remarks.' },
                        { 'icon': '👥', 'title': 'Staff Accounts', 'text': 'Principal, Bursar, Store Keeper and Teacher logins with role-based access.' },
                        { 'icon': '🧑‍🏫', 'title': 'Staff Assignments', 'text': 'Form Teacher, HOD, Year Group Master and Subject Teacher in one click.' }
